OL,3,GNEWSAGift could end annual college
OL,4,Agrants of #2.2m
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrincipals at two private colleges say
OL,7,Fthey may be able to stop receiving an
OL,8,Fannual government grant after receiving
OL,9,Fthe offer of a large financial gift.
OL,11,FElizabeth College and The Ladies'
OL,12,FCollege said the offer from a
OL,13,Fphilanthropist involved changing how
OL,14,Fthey were funded and would allow both
OL,15,Fcolleges to give up their annual States
OL,16,Fgrant, which is worth about #2.2m.
OL,18,FThey said it would also allow bursaries
OL,19,Fat both schools and support an
OL,20,Fisland-wide "legacy programme".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
