OL,3,GNEWSAGift could end annual college
OL,4,Agrants of #2.2m
OL,5,
OL,6,FTo accept the donation both colleges
OL,7,Fneed to be independent charities.
OL,8,FElizabeth College is already one while
OL,9,FThe Ladies' College is governed by a
OL,10,F1962 law, which the States would need
OL,11,Fto change to allow it to be one.
